  },
  {
   "id": "t-85",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1100,
   "y": 262,
   "w": 764,
   "h": 120,
   "text": "Tab order: skip link → rail → comms → content (Menu list: arrows move, Enter opens) → orb zones. Arrows / PageUp-Down step sections, Esc closes LINKS and ends the game. The game by keys as today (WASD, Space, R, C). Focus ring: 2px signal on :focus-visible, always visible, never clipped.",
   "size": 14,
   "weight": 400,
   "font": "sans",
   "color": "#C9B8C4",
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top"
  },
  {
   "id": "t-86",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1100,
   "y": 390,
   "w": 764,
   "h": 24,
   "text": "Screen readers",
   "size": 15,
   "weight": 700,
   "font": "sans",
   "color": "#8b93a7",
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "caps": true
  },
  {
   "id": "t-87",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1100,
   "y": 420,
   "w": 764,
   "h": 120,
   "text": "Landmarks: nav (rail), main (section content), aside (comms). One h1 per section (its title), h2 for entries. Rail and Menu list are tablists (aria-selected, aria-controls). The sky canvas is aria-hidden with one sr-only line about the game. Cori and scanner changes speak through one polite live region. document.title follows the section.",
   "size": 14,
   "weight": 400,
   "font": "sans",
   "color": "#C9B8C4",
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top"
  },
  {
   "id": "t-88",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1100,
   "y": 548,
   "w": 764,
   "h": 24,
   "text": "Touch & sizes",
   "size": 15,
   "weight": 700,
   "font": "sans",
   "color": "#8b93a7",
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "caps": true
  },
  {
   "id": "t-89",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1100,
   "y": 578,
   "w": 764,
   "h": 100,
   "text": "44px hit areas on coarse pointers (Controls). Orb zones are real buttons with labels. No text under 10px (Type); body 14, reading 16 where the user zooms. Zoom to 200% keeps every frame usable (they scroll inside).",
   "size": 14,
   "weight": 400,
   "font": "sans",
   "color": "#C9B8C4",
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top"
  },
  {
   "id": "t-90",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1100,
   "y": 686,
   "w": 764,
   "h": 24,
   "text": "Motion",
   "size": 15,
   "weight": 700,
   "font": "sans",
